{
  "isDisabled": false,
  "name": "(04) Bentheimer VTK Interchange.d3dpipeline",
  "pinnedParams": [],
  "pipeline": [
    {
      "args": {
        "input_file_path": {
          "value": "Data/Output/Bentheimer_Resolution_Examples/Regions/InteriorRegionComparison.dream3d",
          "version": 1
        },
        "output_file_path": {
          "value": "Data/Output/Bentheimer_Resolution_Examples/Interchange/BentheimerRegionProcessing.d3dpipeline",
          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 1
      },
      "comments": "Recover the processing recipe embedded in the predecessor DREAM3D checkpoint beside the VTK round-trip result. This is provenance for example 03 only; it does not bundle raw data, earlier stages, binaries or GUI state. Inspect paths before replaying because outputs may be overwritten. The predecessor must exist before preflight.",
      "filter": {
        "name": "nx::core::ExtractPipelineToFileFilter",
        "uuid": "27203c99-9975-4528-88cc-42b270165d79"
      },
      "isDisabled": false
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "import_data_object": {
          "value": {
            "data_paths": [],
            "file_path": "Data/Output/Bentheimer_Resolution_Examples/Regions/InteriorRegionComparison.dream3d",
            "path_import_policy": 0
          },
          "version": 2
        },
        "parameters_version": 1
      },
      "comments": "Read the complete predecessor checkpoint with import policy All. Retain the padded reference for VTK comparison and the unpadded fine ROI for contouring, with all existing context arrays. An include-list would require path_import_policy=1; a nonempty list is ignored by policy 0.",
      "filter": {
        "name": "nx::core::ReadDREAM3DFilter",
        "uuid": "0dbd31c7-19e0-4077-83ef-f4a6459a0e2d"
      },
      "isDisabled": false
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "input_file": {
          "value": "Data/Output/Bentheimer_Resolution_Examples/Regions/BentheimerPaddedROI6um.vtk",
          "version": 1
        },
        "read_point_data": {
          "value": false,
          "version": 1
        },
        "read_cell_data": {
          "value": true,
          "version": 1
        },
        "output_vertex_geometry_path": {
          "value": "UnusedPointData",
          "version": 1
        },
        "vertex_attribute_matrix_name": {
          "value": "Vertex Data",
          "version": 1
        },
        "output_image_geometry_path": {
          "value": "VTKImportedROI",
          "version": 1
        },
        "cell_attribute_matrix_name": {
          "value": "CellData",
          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 1
      },
      "comments": "Read CELL_DATA only from the predecessor export. The file must exist before preflight; point counts in its header are one larger per axis than the imported cell dimensions.",
      "filter": {
        "name": "nx::core::ReadVtkStructuredPointsFilter",
        "uuid": "60d55662-ca7a-4be7-b0a0-ed6e785eb51b"
      },
      "isDisabled": false
    },
