        },
        "contour_value": {
          "value": 0.400025,
          "version": 1
        }
      },
      "comments": "Extract the 0.400025 contour from the unpadded measured fine ROI. The levels correspond to 8000.5 and 10000.5 original normalized counts, divided by 20000. Half-count positions avoid exact ties with quantized cell values. They bracket part of the low-count intensity interval between dark and bright bands; neither is a calibrated pore/solid threshold. Float32 signal preserves the fractional level. Avoid artificial closure against padding fill.",
      "isDisabled": false
    },
    {
